    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** Blend is seeing a broad-based recovery, with mortgage origination activity rebounding and its consumer banking suite maintaining steady expansion. Loan funded volumes on the platform surged, reflecting stronger end-market demand and deeper customer engagement. The business is shifting pipeline toward bundled deals, while AI-driven features like Autopilot are accelerating adoption. This combination of improving cyclical conditions and product innovation is creating tangible operating momentum, positioning Blend to capture a larger share of digital origination flows across both mortgage and consumer banking channels.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership has navigated the cycle effectively and is now pivoting to an agent-first AI strategy, aiming to drive efficiency and speed, with a path to growth acceleration in 2027 signaled. The company consistently exceeded its own revenue and profitability guidance, generated positive free cash flow, maintained a debt-free balance sheet, and actively repurchased shares. This execution discipline, together with the upbeat outlook and strategic focus on automation, is building credibility that Blend can translate improving market conditions into sustained operating leverage.",
